{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:07 2026-11-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：19:07 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：19:07 2026-11-03 HKT</p><img alt=\"佐敦德成街地盤疑鑿爆水管 工人趕至搶修\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/7d1955bf6853b02ec7ca23e1d6701a85/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_18_11_38_2__0.jpeg\"/><p>佐敦德成街今日（11月3日）下午時分，有路面地盤疑鑿爆水管，黃泥水柱噴湧至路面，途人紛紛四散。隨後人員趕至關細水掣搶修，地盤深坑被積水填滿。據了解，意外爆裂為一條食水管，附近餐廳供水暫時未受影響。</p><p>現場所見，相關地盤有水務署標誌。水務署紀錄顯示，佐敦德成街一帶昨日（11月2日）有兩項鹹水管緊急維修工程，其中一項仍在搶修，影響德成街1至5號範圍，預計周三（11月4日）凌晨才完成，未知是次意外是否涉及該地盤及影響進度。</p><img alt=\"現場為佐敦德成街。曾志恆攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b0a557314af9964f6f9d14d5171a3e03/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_18_11_40_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場為佐敦德成街。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6147287e425a0d250fe79777c7e95f49/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_18_11_37_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"工程懷疑鑿爆水管。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8fdedcf14981f050df9fd0922a8cf800/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_18_11_39.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"積水填滿地盤深坑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a4ccc3f044fe857f3c3824e5c4256e05/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_18_11_39_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"積水填滿地盤深坑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2d178685152cd094ae1cc125ae826ac6/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_18_11_38_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"相關地盤有水務署標誌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/7c10c84dc2683eca6888282370f2d700/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-03_at_18_11_40.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T11:43:03.442307+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":292,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T11:07:52+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T11:38:47.665105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T11:38:47.665105+00:00","content_hash":"0cab84a89bc2b4a7263d8e700ddf7665b6949a997a1cc127ede28dcc44c5469a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}